labware_catalogue.json and liquid_classes.json are lists of labware and liquid classes exported from a Hamilton Microlab Prep.
They are included so the Builder and converter offer exactly what the instrument knows. They are not covered by this
project's MIT license and remain the property of their owners. If you are the owner and want them removed, open an issue.
Generate your own with GET /labware and GET /liquids on your instrument, then run scripts/build-prep-catalogue.js.

Use at your own risk: this software drives a laboratory robot. Test in simulation first.
